<title>USA: Reliance Financial Services Corp Q4 net increases.</title>
<headline>Reliance Financial Services Corp Q4 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliance Financial Services Corp, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Reliance Group Holdings Inc, reported fourth quarter earnings.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Net			     60			 39</p>
<p> Revs			   809			738</p>
<p>			   year</p>
<p> Net			    140			172</p>
<p> Revs			 3,105		    2,922</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for fiscal year 1996 included an $87.1 million after tax charge from an increase in asbestos-related and environmental pollution reserves.</p>
<p>Net income for fiscal 1996 included a loss on the disposal of discontinued operations of $4,497,000 and an extraordinary item of $3,363,000 for the extinguishment of debt.</p>
</text>
